"     The --force mgrpush option is disabled on this server.\n"
"     Please contact your SUSE Multi-Linux Manager administrator for more help.\n"
"     "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"     ຕົວເລືອກ --force mgrpush ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານໃນເຊີເວີນີ້.\n"
"     ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ SUSE Multi-Linux Manager ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ.\n"
"     "

#: ../common/rhnException.py:161
msgid ""
"\n"
"     The activation token specified could not be found on the server.\n"
"     Please retry with a valid key.\n"
"     "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"     ບໍ່ພົບໂທເຄັນການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation token) ທີ່ລະບຸໃນເຊີເວີ.\n"
"     ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"     "

